cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If PolySparQ++ supports your research, please cite this repository."
title: "PolySparQ++"
type: software
abstract: >-
  PolySparQ++ is an independent C++20 Polymarket bot for prediction-market research,
  paper trading, risk controls, and optional live order execution. It includes a
  Python operations cockpit, PostgreSQL persistence, replay tools, and a mobile client.
keywords:
  - Polymarket
  - Polymarket bot
  - prediction markets
  - trading bot
  - paper trading
  - algorithmic trading
authors:
